      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for the suggested patch.\n\nI believe the current implementation is correct.\nMaybe you copied the implementation of [`HasAlpha32b_SSE2`](https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp/+/3cd16fd3e2a754444be45b6d713770a09fb3b4f4/src/dsp/alpha_processing_sse2.c#305)? But [`length` is multiplied by 4 there](https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp/+/3cd16fd3e2a754444be45b6d713770a09fb3b4f4/src/dsp/alpha_processing_sse2.c#277).\n\nCould you provide a way to reproduce the out-of-bounds error you encountered?",
      "revId": "1c07273b12df55d3fdc1ca80ea9aa8de2e646844",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
