      "writtenOn": "2024-05-22T09:06:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In other words, this function will return 1 even if the \u0027src\u0027 contains all 0xff because it will perform unnecessary iterations and will encounter non-0xff somewhere outside the input buffer.",
      "revId": "1c07273b12df55d3fdc1ca80ea9aa8de2e646844",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
